{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:58e91dcdcec6ba4f758d31b67e7b46ff975d47d9b34a7bd0284319e4c5c42c0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c96f98dd087046c48cffb500dbf7849f9c1c24b449060c74f883dd7eba90686",
      "text": "看完演唱会DVD后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3880037d8c82b7bd17f3ef12f769766094bcb0280ae0099500932017a06b349c",
      "text": "偶像的演唱会，比想象中要炽热得多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebfddbdc15bdee7d6f2e91493e02808fa2476e0f6d9504787d7ad1e7b1182b6b",
      "text": "虽然也有轻浮的地方，\n但在该帅气的时候，确实帅得很彻底。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13c1b0def76e0db47234882558adfaa2a32b302ec457fb984535ad8b1ba59650",
      "text": "（演出时间大概两小时左右吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff31a488ee332cdc6a5a4cb8ab28c424f8f07fd12382558c934b525789faf3d",
      "text": "（在这期间几乎不间断地又唱又跳，\n没有体力是绝对撑不下来的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3594b34464593a39e01a3628d095d11e9b567ec70004067a2095e15780240ced",
      "text": "（在前后的舞台之间来回奔跑了好几次。\n而且中途还要边跑边唱，负担更重了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd0f0ca36577404ad42b26c8a4bf4ade16e199ddf2f1fa077bdda9e0118d3d5",
      "text": "好了，接下来看看特典吧。\n开始期待会是什么内容了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfbc296f01857badd73936bd83cf7e743713095c55951f02ab9bebff7e9a632",
      "text": "我们从前半部分的歌单整体过一遍开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ffd7e953c039193c708ca60a546a84067565c1c4cba0f421b0269d438cd47a",
      "text": "这是……直到演出当天的贴身跟拍吗。\n能看到幕后花絮可真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23b34af75dbdd6772deb9e0801707ce934056667a62a1c21fc586c543562df8",
      "text": "到底要经过多少练习，才能完成那样的舞台，\n看来能从中找到了解的线索了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
